  unitName: Ruin Zellha
  unitId: 50474
  unitNumber: 574
  description: A goddess that wanted to deceive the other gods in order to use them.
    On a whim, she made her way to the Bariura Empire where she grew close to a dark
    magician. However, this magician turned the tables on her, using the goddess
    to gain her knowledge and power. Enraged, Zellha tried to use other higher ranking
    gods to seek revenge, but contrary to her expectations, the gods didn't budge
    and were captured instead. After that, regardless of her own intentions, she
    decided to destroy all humans, taking the initiative by heading towards the battlefield.
  summonDesc: Ah! You're here, you're here!<br>I have a favor to ask you! <br>Do
    you wanna sink the world into further chaos with me?
  fusionDesc: That's not nearly enough!<br> You think I'll be satisfied with that
    mere morsel?<br> More, more, bring me more!
  evoDesc: If I can have just this bit of power, then next time he...<br>Oh! You
    were still here? <br>Go away already!
  element: 5
  rarity: 4
